  "content": {
    "id": "p20-q11-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "11",
    "prompt": "Pham throws a ball at a velocity of $8.7\\text{ m s}^{-1}$ at an angle of $55^\\circ$. Use $g=9.8\\text{ m s}^{-2}$ and neglect air resistance. Find:",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p20-q11-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "the maximum height reached (to 2 d.p.).",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2.59\\text{ m}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\dot{x}&=8.7\\cos55^\\circ\\\\\\dot{y}&=-9.8t+8.7\\sin55^\\circ\\\\y&=-4.9t^2+8.7t\\sin55^\\circ\\end{aligned}$$\nAt maximum height, $\\dot y=0$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}0&=-9.8t+8.7\\sin55^\\circ\\\\t_{\\max}&=\\frac{8.7\\sin55^\\circ}{9.8}\\\\&\\approx0.7272\\text{ s}\\\\y_{\\max}&=-4.9\\left(\\frac{8.7\\sin55^\\circ}{9.8}\\right)^2+8.7\\sin55^\\circ\\left(\\frac{8.7\\sin55^\\circ}{9.8}\\right)\\\\&\\approx2.59\\text{ m}\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p20-q11-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "how far from Pham it lands (to 1 d.p.).",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$7.3\\text{ m}$",
          "worked": "For landing at the launch height, the time of flight is twice the time to maximum height.\n$$\\begin{aligned}t_{\\text{flight}}&=2\\left(\\frac{8.7\\sin55^\\circ}{9.8}\\right)\\\\&\\approx1.4544\\text{ s}\\\\x(t_{\\text{flight}})&=8.7\\cos55^\\circ\\left(\\frac{2(8.7\\sin55^\\circ)}{9.8}\\right)\\\\&\\approx7.3\\text{ m}\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      }
    ]
  },
